  "prompt": "For each channel, what share of its spend from 1 July to 31 October 2025, both days included, went to its top campaign? spend_date is a UTC day, a campaign's spend is the sum of its spend in ad_spend_daily over those days, and a channel's spend is the sum over its campaigns. The top campaign spent the most; when two campaigns of a channel tie on spend, the one with the lower campaign_id is the top campaign. Return four columns, in this order: channel_id, campaign_id (the top campaign), spend (its spend) and share_pct, that spend as a percentage of the channel's spend, rounded to 1 decimal. Return one row for each channel with spend in that period. Any row order is fine.",
